  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring the Custom design.\r\n\r\nPositioned in an exclusive gated community in Gulf Harbour, this home is expertly designed by LTD Architectural Design Studio to capture maximum sun, incredible Hauraki Gulf views, and meet all the development guidelines.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a tailored layout ready for your personal choices and custom finishes, this home is designed to showcase stunning Hauraki Gulf views. Council fees, extensive decks, and complete landscaping are all included for total peace of mind.\r\n\r\nInside, enjoy high stud heights throughout and dramatic raking ceilings—creating an airy, light-filled environment that is perfect for entertaining.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
